{
  "name": "LX-Voice-Reception",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lx/voice/inbound",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-twilio-inbound",
      "name": "Webhook Twilio Inbound",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "webhookId": "lx-voice-inbound",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Webhook Twilio pour appels entrants"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Parse le payload Twilio\nconst body = $json.body || $json;\n\nconst callSid = body.CallSid;\nconst from = body.From || body.Caller;\nconst to = body.To || body.Called;\nconst callStatus = body.CallStatus;\nconst direction = body.Direction || 'inbound';\nconst recordingUrl = body.RecordingUrl || null;\nconst transcription = body.TranscriptionText || null;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    call_sid: callSid,\n    phone_from: from,\n    phone_to: to,\n    call_status: callStatus,\n    direction: direction,\n    recording_url: recordingUrl,\n    transcript: transcription,\n    raw_payload: body\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "code-parse-twilio",
      "name": "Parse Twilio Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [450, 300],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Parse les données Twilio"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.transcript }}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-has-transcript",
      "name": "If Has Transcript",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [650, 300],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Vérifie si transcription disponible"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.twilio.com/2010-04-01/Accounts/{{ $env.TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID }}/Recordings/{{ $('Parse Twilio Payload').item.json.call_sid }}/Transcriptions.json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpBasicAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "twilio-get-transcription",
      "name": "Get Twilio Transcription",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [850, 450],
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "twilio-lx-cred",
          "name": "Twilio-LX"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Récupère la transcription depuis Twilio si pas déjà fournie"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Utilise la transcription existante ou celle récupérée\nconst parseData = $('Parse Twilio Payload').item.json;\nlet transcript = parseData.transcript;\n\nif (!transcript) {\n  // Essayer de récupérer depuis la réponse Twilio\n  const twilioResponse = $json;\n  if (twilioResponse.transcriptions && twilioResponse.transcriptions.length > 0) {\n    transcript = twilioResponse.transcriptions[0].transcription_text;\n  } else {\n    transcript = 'Transcription non disponible';\n  }\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...parseData,\n    transcript: transcript\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "code-merge-transcript",
      "name": "Merge Transcript",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1050, 350],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Fusionne les données avec la transcription"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "model": "claude-3-5-haiku-20241022",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokens": 2048
        },
        "text": "=Tu es un assistant spécialisé dans l'analyse d'appels téléphoniques entrants.\nTon rôle est d'extraire l'intention principale et de résumer l'appel en quelques phrases claires.\n\nAnalyse cette transcription d'appel téléphonique :\n\nTRANSCRIPTION :\n---\n{{ $json.transcript }}\n---\n\nExtrais et structure les informations suivantes au format JSON :\n\n{\n  \"intent\": \"string (parmi : 'demande_devis', 'support_technique', 'information', 'reclamation', 'autre')\",\n  \"urgency\": \"string (parmi : 'low', 'medium', 'high', 'critical')\",\n  \"summary\": \"string (résumé en 2-3 phrases max)\",\n  \"action_required\": \"boolean (true si nécessite un suivi humain)\",\n  \"suggested_response\": \"string (réponse suggérée pour callback ou SMS)\",\n  \"lead_quality\": \"string (si demande_devis : 'cold', 'warm', 'hot')\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"string (parmi : 'positive', 'neutral', 'negative')\"\n}\n\nRÈGLES :\n- intent : détermine l'intention principale de l'appel\n- urgency : évalue l'urgence du besoin\n- summary : résumé factuel et concis\n- action_required : true si nécessite intervention humaine urgente\n- suggested_response : proposition de réponse courtoise et utile\n- lead_quality : si c'est une demande de devis, évalue la maturité\n- sentiment : analyse le ton général de l'appelant\n\nRetourne UNIQUEMENT le JSON, sans markdown."
      },
      "id": "anthropic-analyze-call",
      "name": "Claude Analyze Call",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 350],
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "anthropic-lx-cred",
          "name": "Anthropic-LX"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Analyse de l'appel via Claude (intent, urgence, résumé)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "// Parse la réponse JSON de Claude\nconst claudeResponse = $json.output || $json.response || '{}';\nlet analysisData;\n\ntry {\n  let cleanJson = claudeResponse;\n  if (typeof claudeResponse === 'string') {\n    cleanJson = claudeResponse.replace(/```json\\n?/g, '').replace(/```\\n?/g, '').trim();\n  }\n  analysisData = typeof cleanJson === 'string' ? JSON.parse(cleanJson) : cleanJson;\n} catch (e) {\n  analysisData = {\n    intent: 'autre',\n    urgency: 'medium',\n    summary: 'Analyse non disponible',\n    action_required: true,\n    suggested_response: 'Merci pour votre appel. Nous reviendrons vers vous rapidement.',\n    lead_quality: 'cold',\n    sentiment: 'neutral'\n  };\n}\n\nreturn { json: analysisData };"
      },
      "id": "code-parse-analysis",
      "name": "Parse Analysis JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1450, 350],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Parse l'analyse de Claude"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id FROM contacts WHERE phone = '{{ $('Merge Transcript').item.json.phone_from }}' LIMIT 1"
      },
      "id": "supabase-find-contact",
      "name": "Find Contact by Phone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1650, 250],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-lx-cred",
          "name": "Supabase-LX"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Cherche un contact existant par numéro de téléphone"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{ $json.length }}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-contact-not-exists",
      "name": "If Contact Not Exists",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1850, 250],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Vérifie si contact existe"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "tableId": "contacts",
        "columnsUi": {
          "columnValues": [
            {
              "column": "phone",
              "value": "={{ $('Merge Transcript').item.json.phone_from }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "email",
              "value": "unknown@voice.lxstudio.ch"
            },
            {
              "column": "language",
              "value": "fr"
            },
            {
              "column": "source",
              "value": "voice"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "supabase-create-contact",
      "name": "Create Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2050, 150],
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "supabase-lx-cred",
          "name": "Supabase-LX"
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Crée un nouveau contact si n'existe pas"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "insert",
        "tableId": "voice_calls",
        "columnsUi": {
          "columnValues": [
            {
              "column": "contact_id",
              "value": "={{ $('If Contact Not Exists').item.json.id || $('Create Contact').item.json.id }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "twilio_call_sid",
              "value": "={{ $('Merge Transcript').item.json.call_sid }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "phone_from",
              "value": "={{ $('Merge Transcript').item.json.phone_from }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "phone_to",
              "value": "={{ $('Merge Transcript').item.json.phone_to }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "direction",
